  "description": "The text 'i'm a serial pedofile' is a self-referential accusation directed at the man in the image. The visual material (the man) is mapped onto the textual entity 'i'm a serial pedofile', creating an analogical mapping where the man is being portrayed as the entity making the accusation. This mapping is central to the meme's hateful intent, as it falsely associates the man with a heinous crime.",
